 .. autofunction:: base64_encode
 
 .. autofunction:: base64_decode
+
+URL-safe Base64 uses ``-`` and ``_`` in place of ``+`` and ``/``;
+:func:`base64_encode` omits ``=`` padding and :func:`base64_decode` restores it
+when required.
